---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Findings
kicker: Report 2026 · 1st wave
lead: The key results of the study, theme by theme. Each theme summarises one chapter of the report.
description: Key findings of the AI & People at Work study, theme by theme.
---

<section aria-labelledby="levels-heading" class="section">
  <h2 id="levels-heading">Four levels</h2>
  <p>{{ home.levels.text }}</p>
  <ul class="level-list">
    {%- for level in home.levels.items %}
    <li><a href="{{ level.url }}"><strong>{{ level.name }}</strong> <span>{{ level.text }}</span></a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="themes-heading" class="section">
  <h2 id="themes-heading">All themes</h2>
  <div class="theme-grid">
    {%- for item in collections.themes %}{% if item.data.status != "upcoming" %}
    {% include "components/theme-card.njk" %}
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="upcoming-heading" class="section">
  <h2 id="upcoming-heading">Coming next</h2>
  <p>Future waves of the survey will add new themes and show how things change over time.</p>
  <div class="theme-grid">
    {%- for item in collections.themes %}{% if item.data.status == "upcoming" %}
    {% include "components/theme-card.njk" %}
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
